    "preamble": "Sri Bimal Kumar Modi vs Union Of India And Ors on 4 July, 2022 Author: Md. Nizamuddin Bench: Md. Nizamuddin Od -8 Order",
    "facts": "On perusal of the prayers made in the writ petition, it appears that petitioner has made a prayer for direction upon the respondents concerned to send fresh sample of imported goods in question under Bill of Entry No.7939802 dated 05th September, 2019 to any accredited laboratory under the Food Safety and Standard Acts, 2006.",
    "arguments": "Learned Advocates appearing for the respondent authorities submit that in view of the development taken place during the pendency of the writ petition, no relief can be granted to the petitioner in terms of the prayers ask for in the writ petition since the goods in question is no more in existence.",
